# The whole access model, in one rule.
#
# A client may read and write inside a single room, and rooms are named by a
# secret only their two members can derive:
#
#     ec/<room-topic>/<sender-client-id>
#
# `ec/+/+` matches exactly one room and one sender. It does NOT match `ec/#`,
# so a client cannot subscribe to everything and enumerate the network — the
# one property GossipSub gives for free and MQTT does not.
topic readwrite ec/+/+

# Deny the brokers own telemetry outright.
topic deny $SYS/#
